- `php artisan make:middleware` - HTTP middleware
- `php artisan make:migration` - Database migration
- `php artisan make:model` - Eloquent model
- `php artisan make:notification` - Notification class
- `php artisan make:observer` - Model observer
- `php artisan make:policy` - Authorization policy
- `php artisan make:provider` - Service provider
- `php artisan make:request` - Form request validation
